diff --git a/PROJECT_LAYOUT_V1_8_1.md b/PROJECT_LAYOUT_V1_8_1.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..dc75fd8
--- /dev/null
+++ b/PROJECT_LAYOUT_V1_8_1.md
@@ -0,0 +1,103 @@
+# Flyff RL v1.8.1 — Project-local model and log layout
+
+This release is a path/layout correction on top of mapper RL v1.8. The mapper
+policy, observation contract and reward contract are unchanged.
+
+Runtime version:
+
+```text
+Adaptive mapper 1.8.1-bounded-recovery-project-layout
+```
+
+## Canonical application layout
+
+```text
+foreground_vision_bot/
+├─ models/
+│  ├─ farming/
+│  │  ├─ flyff_ppo.zip
+│  │  └─ checkpoints/
+│  └─ mapping/
+│     ├─ mapper_explorer_ppo.zip
+│     ├─ mapper_explorer_ppo_final.zip
+│     ├─ best/
+│     ├─ checkpoints/
+│     ├─ evaluations/
+│     └─ archive/
+├─ training_logs/
+│  ├─ farming/
+│  └─ mapping/
+└─ tests/
+```
+
+All default paths are now resolved from the directory containing the
+application code. Launching a script from the repository parent, an IDE or a
+different current working directory no longer sends generated files outside
+`foreground_vision_bot`.
+
+## Path changes
+
+| Purpose | Old default | New default |
+|---|---|---|
+| Farming model | `models/flyff_ppo` | `models/farming/flyff_ppo` |
+| Farming checkpoints | `models/checkpoints` | `models/farming/checkpoints` |
+| Farming TensorBoard | `training_logs` | `training_logs/farming` |
+| Mapper selected model | `models/mapper_explorer_ppo` | `models/mapping/mapper_explorer_ppo` |
+| Mapper checkpoints | `models/mapper_checkpoints` | `models/mapping/checkpoints` |
+| Mapper best model | `models/mapper_best` | `models/mapping/best` |
+| Mapper evaluations | `models/mapper_eval` | `models/mapping/evaluations` |
+| Mapper TensorBoard | `training_logs/mapper_rl` | `training_logs/mapping` |
+
+## Install
+
+Apply the patch from the `foreground_vision_bot` application directory, as
+with previous mapper patches:
+
+```powershell
+git apply --check "C:\path\to\adaptive_mapper_v1_8_1_project_layout.patch"
+git apply "C:\path\to\adaptive_mapper_v1_8_1_project_layout.patch"
+python -B -m pytest -q tests
+```
+
+## Migrate existing generated files
+
+Preview the migration first:
+
+```powershell
+python migrate_project_layout.py --dry-run
+```
+
+Then run it:
+
+```powershell
+python migrate_project_layout.py
+```
+
+The migration checks both the application directory and its parent. It:
+
+- moves `flyff_ppo*` and legacy `checkpoints/` into `models/farming/`;
+- moves mapper policies/checkpoints/best/evaluation/archive output, including
+  legacy `best_model*.zip` and `evaluations.npz`, into `models/mapping/`;
+- moves legacy mapper TensorBoard output into `training_logs/mapping/`;
+- treats other legacy root TensorBoard output as farming output;
+- merges a parent-level `tests/` directory into the application `tests/`;
+- never overwrites a different existing file.
+
+A conflict produces exit code 2 and leaves both files untouched.
+
+## Commands after migration
+
+Mapper training and evaluation commands are unchanged:
+
+```powershell
+python train_mapper_policy.py --timesteps 100000 --envs 8
+python evaluate_mapper_policy.py --episodes 100
+```
+
+Their default output is now under `models/mapping/` and
+`training_logs/mapping/`.
+
+Farming training now uses `models/farming/` and `training_logs/farming/`.
+
+Custom `--model-path` values remain supported. Relative custom paths are
+resolved from the application directory; absolute paths are used unchanged.
